sequenceDiagram
    participant WR as WalReceiver
    participant SM as Shared Memory
    participant SP as Startup Process
    participant PF as Prefetcher
    participant RM as Resource Managers
    participant CP as Checkpointer

    Note over WR,CP: Startup Process Integration During WAL Replay

    %% Initialization Phase
    WR->>+SM: Update WalRcvData
    Note right of SM: receivedUpto, flushedUpto

    SM->>+SP: Signal new WAL available
    Note right of SP: Latch-based notification

    SP->>SP: PerformWalRecovery()
    Note right of SP: Main recovery loop entry

    %% WAL Reading with Prefetching
    SP->>+PF: XLogPrefetcherReadRecord()
    Note right of PF: Read with I/O prefetching

    PF->>PF: Check prefetch config changes
    Note right of PF: recovery_prefetch, maintenance_io_concurrency

    PF->>PF: XLogPrefetcherReleasePreviousRecord()
    Note right of PF: Cleanup previous record

    PF->>PF: XLogReadAhead(non-blocking)
    Note right of PF: Initiate async I/O

    PF->>SP: XLogNextRecord()
    Note right of SP: Decoded WAL record

    SP-->>-PF: Record processing complete
    PF-->>-SP: Next record ready

    %% Record Processing and Application
    SP->>SP: HandleStartupProcInterrupts()
    Note right of SP: Process signals

    SP->>SP: Check recovery pause state
    Note right of SP: recoveryPauseState check

    SP->>SP: recoveryStopsBefore()
    Note right of SP: Check recovery target

    SP->>SP: recoveryApplyDelay()
    Note right of SP: Apply configured delay

    SP->>+RM: ApplyWalRecord()
    Note right of RM: Dispatch to resource manager

    RM->>RM: rmgr_redo() function
    Note right of RM: Manager-specific redo

    RM->>RM: Handle Full-Page Images
    Note right of RM: RestoreBlockImage() if needed

    RM-->>-SP: Record applied

    %% Shared State Updates
    SP->>+SM: Update XLogRecoveryCtl
    Note right of SM: Atomic position updates

    SM->>SM: SpinLockAcquire(&info_lck)
    Note right of SM: Protect shared state

    SM->>SM: Update replayEndRecPtr
    Note right of SM: Current replay position

    SM->>SM: Update lastReplayedEndRecPtr
    Note right of SM: Last completed record

    SM->>SM: SpinLockRelease(&info_lck)

    SM-->>-SP: Position updated

    %% Coordination with WalReceiver
    SP->>WR: Coordinate WAL consumption
    Note left of WR: Indirect coordination via shared memory

    WR->>WR: Check GetXLogReplayRecPtr()
    Note right of WR: Current replay position

    WR->>WR: Adjust feedback timing
    Note right of WR: Based on replay progress

    %% Checkpointer Coordination
    SP->>+CP: RequestCheckpoint() [conditional]
    Note right of CP: Memory pressure or interval

    CP->>CP: Check RecoveryInProgress()
    Note right of CP: Determine checkpoint type

    CP->>CP: CreateRestartPoint()
    Note right of CP: Recovery-specific checkpoint

    CP->>SM: Update checkpoint state
    Note right of SM: Coordinate with ongoing replay

    CP-->>-SP: Checkpoint complete

    %% Memory Management Integration
    SP->>SP: Check memory pressure
    Note right of SP: Buffer pool utilization

    alt High Memory Pressure
        SP->>CP: Force immediate checkpoint
        Note right of CP: CHECKPOINT_IMMEDIATE
        CP->>CP: Accelerated buffer cleaning
        CP-->>SP: Memory pressure relieved
    else Normal Operation
        SP->>SP: Continue normal replay
    end

    %% Error Handling and Recovery
    alt WAL Read Error
        SP->>SP: WALReadError()
        Note right of SP: Handle corruption/missing WAL

        SP->>WR: Signal need for WAL
        Note left of WR: Request retransmission

        WR->>WR: Reconnect if needed
        WR-->>SP: WAL available

    else Timeline Switch
        SP->>SP: Detect timeline change
        Note right of SP: Timeline ID mismatch

        SP->>SP: readTimeLineHistory()
        Note right of SP: Fetch timeline history

        SP->>SP: Validate timeline switch
        Note right of SP: Ensure consistency

        SP->>WR: Update timeline requirements
        Note left of WR: New timeline context

    else Recovery Target Reached
        SP->>SP: recoveryStopsAfter()
        Note right of SP: Check inclusive target

        SP->>SP: Exit recovery loop
        Note right of SP: Prepare for promotion

        SP->>SM: Signal recovery complete
        Note right of SM: Update recovery state
    end

    %% Performance Optimization
    Note over SP,PF: Prefetching Optimization
    SP->>PF: XLogPrefetcherComputeStats()
    Note right of PF: Periodic statistics update

    PF->>PF: Adjust prefetch distance
    Note right of PF: Based on hit ratios

    Note over SP,RM: Resource Manager Coordination
    SP->>RM: RmgrStartup()
    Note right of RM: Initialize managers

    SP->>RM: RmgrCleanup()
    Note right of RM: Cleanup on completion

    %% Continuous Loop Coordination
    loop Continuous Replay
        WR->>SM: New WAL received
        SM->>SP: Wake startup process
        SP->>PF: Read next record
        PF-->>SP: Record available
        SP->>RM: Apply record
        RM-->>SP: Record applied
        SP->>SM: Update positions
        SM-->>WR: Position feedback
    end

    Note over WR,CP: End Startup Process Integration